{"code":"BL23","wikidata":"Q13021853","wikipedia":{"en":"Huai Khwang MRT station","th":"สถานีห้วยขวาง"},"summary":{"en":"Huai Khwang station is a MRT station on the Blue Line in Bangkok, Thailand. It is located under Ratchadaphisek Road, near the MRT Depot. Before the station's opening, the plan was to name it Pracha Rat Bamphen.","th":"สถานีห้วยขวาง เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าใต้ดิน ในเส้นทางรถไฟฟ้ามหานคร สายเฉลิมรัชมงคล ที่ถนนรัชดาภิเษก กรุงเทพมหานคร ตั้งอยู่ในย่านอาคารที่พักอาศัย โรงแรม และสถานเริงรมย์บนถนนรัชดาภิเษก"},"opened":"2004-07-03","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Huai_Khwang_Station_MRT_%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%96%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B5_%E0%B8%AB%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87_%28April2021%29_01.jpg/960px-Huai_Khwang_Station_MRT_%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%96%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B5_%E0%B8%AB%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87_%28April2021%29_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Huai_Khwang_Station_MRT_%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%96%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B5_%E0%B8%AB%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87_(April2021)_01.jpg","author":"Chainwit.","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/aa/Huai_Khwang_at_night_-_panoramio.jpg/960px-Huai_Khwang_at_night_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Huai_Khwang_at_night_-_panoramio.jpg","author":"carbon60","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Huai_Khwang_Station_concourse_level_%281%29.jpg/960px-Huai_Khwang_Station_concourse_level_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Huai_Khwang_Station_concourse_level_(1).jpg","author":"